<TITLE>Wind Noise Reduction Structure</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>By reducing the step between the windshield glass and roof, the airflow has been made smoother and appearance has been improved.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Taking into account the airflow between the hood panel and windshield glass, the cowl louver has a raised shape and the wiper arms are optimally arranged so that wind does not directly hit the wiper blades, reducing wind noise.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
